title: "PulseBoard Platform"
abstract: >-
  Real-time microservices dashboard platform composed of a Python/Flask User
  API, a Go analytics engine, and a TypeScript/Express notification service.
  Provides user management, event tracking with time-series aggregation, and
  multi-channel notification delivery behind a unified API surface.
